  <name>Tucnak</name>
  <summary>HF/VHF contest logging program</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Tucnak is HF/VHF/UHF/SHF log for hamradio contests. It supports multi bands, free input, networking, voice and CW keyer, WWL database and much more.
